" end="00:31.111">wonder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.155" end="00:33.664"><span begin="00:32.155" end="00:32.362">Yeah </span><span begin="00:32.362" end="00:32.593">do </span><span begin="00:32.593" end="00:32.808">you </span><span begin="00:32.808" end="00:33.015">ever </span><span begin="00:33.015" end="00:33.664">wonder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.669" end="00:36.738"><span begin="00:33.669" end="00:33.980">What </span><span begin="00:33.980" end="00:35.374">he </span><span begin="00:35.374" end="00:35.629">might </span><span begin="00:35.629" end="00:35.836">be </span><span begin="00:35.836" end="00:36.059">going </span><span begin="00:36.059" end="00:36.738">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.744" end="00:37.956"><span begin="00:36.744" end="00:36.975">On </span><span begin="00:36.975" end="00:37.198">his </span><span begin="00:37.198" end="00:37.453">own </span><span begin="00:37.453" end="00:37.956">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.280" end="00:40.418"><span begin="00:38.280" end="00:38.455">The </span><span begin="00:38.455" end="00:38.670">demons </span><span begin="00:38.670" end="00:38.853">that </span><span begin="00:38.853" end="00:39.076">he's </span><span begin="00:39.076" end="00:39.531">facing </span><span begin="00:39.531" end="00:40.418">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.424" end="00:43.440"><span begin="00:40.424" end="00:41.439">I </span><span begin="00:41.439" end="00:41.646">hate </span><span begin="00:41.646" end="00:41.837">that </span><span begin="00:41.837" end="00:42.140">sometimes </span><span begin="00:42.140" end="00:42.435">I </span><span begin="00:42.435" end="00:42.722">can't </span><span begin="00:42.722" end="00:42.961">go </span><span begin="00:42.961" end="00:43.440">home</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.448" end="00:46.990"><span begin="00:43.448" end="00:44.159">And </span><span begin="00:44.159" end="00:44.422">it </span><span begin="00:44.422" end="00: