"00:56.199" end="00:56.438">just </span><span begin="00:56.438" end="00:56.685">look </span><span begin="00:56.685" end="00:56.884">in </span><span begin="00:56.884" end="00:57.059">the </span><span begin="00:57.059" end="00:57.810">mirror</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.820" end="01:00.590"><span begin="00:57.820" end="00:58.100">No </span><span begin="00:58.100" end="00:58.347">one's </span><span begin="00:58.347" end="00:59.065">gonna </span><span begin="00:59.065" end="00:59.440">save </span><span begin="00:59.440" end="00:59.855">you </span><span begin="00:59.855" end="01:00.590">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.932" end="01:03.591"><span begin="01:00.932" end="01:01.259">So </span><span begin="01:01.259" end="01:01.514">you </span><span begin="01:01.514" end="01:02.145">better </span><span begin="01:02.145" end="01:02.552">save </span><span begin="01:02.552" end="01:03.591">yourself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.372" end="01:06.761"><span begin="01:04.372" end="01:04.859">And </span><span begin="01:04.859" end="01:05.930">everybody's </span><span begin="01:05.930" end="01:06.761">hurting</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.764" end="01:09.355"><span begin="01:06.764" end="01:07.510">Everybody's </span><span begin="01:07.510" end="01:08.317">going </span><span begin="01:08.317" end="01:08.700">through </span><span begin="01:08.700" end="01:09.355">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.895" end="01:12.593"><span begin="01:09.895" end="01:10.206">But </span><span begin="01:10.206" end="01:10.477">you </span><span begin="01:10.477" end="01:11.012">just </span><span begin="01:11.012" end="01:11.299">can't </span><span begin="01:11.299" end="01:11.706">give </span><span begin="01:11.706" end="01:12.154">up </span><span begin="01:12.154" end="01:12.593">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.912" end="01:15.509"><span begin="01:12.912" end="01:13.159">'Cause </span><span begin="01:13.159" end="01:13.494">you </span><span begin="01:13.494" end="01:14.181">gotta </span><span begin="01:14.181" end="01:14.684">save </span><span begin="01:14.684" end="01:15.509">yourself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.562" end="01:18.678"><span begin="01:17.562" end="01:17.721">The </span><span begin="01:17.721" end="01:17.920">sun'll </span><span begin="01:17.920" end="01:18.135">come </span><span begin="01:18.135" end="01:18.678">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.946" end="01:22.815"><span begin="01:19.946" end="01:20.481">Nothing </span><span begin="01:20.481" end="01:20.856">good </span><span begin="01:20.856" end="01:21.505">ever </span><span begin="01:21.505" end="01:22.120">comes </span><span begin="01:22.120" end="01:22.815">easy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.060" end="01:24.791"><span begin="01:23.060" end="01:23.411">I </span><span begin="01:23.411" end="01:23.650">know </span><span begin="01:23.650" end="01:23.977">times </span><span begin="01:23.977" end="01:24.224">are </span><span begin="01:24.224" end="01:24.791">rough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.572" end="01:27.057"><span begin="01:25.572" end="01:25.827">But </span><span begin="01:25.827" end="01:26.282">winners </span><span begin="01:26.282" end="01:26.553">don't </span><span begin="01:26.553" end="01:27.057">quit</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.292" end="01:28.551"><span begin="01:27.292" end="01:27.507">So </span><span begin="01:27.507" end="01:27.698">don't </span><span begin="01:27.698" end="01:27.881">you </span><span begin="01:27.881" end="01:28.056">give </span><span begin="01:28.056" end="01:28.551">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.484" end="01:30.706"><span begin="01:29.484" end="01:29.627">The </span><span begin="01:29.627" end="01:29.914">sun'll </span><span begin="01:29.914" end="01:30.145">come </span><span begin="01:30.145" end="01:30.706">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.854" end="01:34.560"><span begin="01:31.854" end="01:32.061">But </span><